ix.net/325cf4e7/uploads/origins/6b503e0d-7337-4d6b-9f9d-82314dee7959?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b91bd72e8563c32ff3da6cb4cee4b48e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/325cf4e7/uploads/origins/6b503e0d-7337-4d6b-9f9d-82314dee7959?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b91bd72e8563c32ff3da6cb4cee4b48e, https://si.imgix.net/325cf4e7/uploads/origins/6b503e0d-7337-4d6b-9f9d-82314dee7959?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1994ee9c56619f604e1d60d8cd9236e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/325cf4e7/uploads/origins/6b503e0d-7337-4d6b-9f9d-82314dee7959?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=eb5367ba78531c0c6b3b28b05af9aa2f 3x"}, "body": "Kobato-san, nice to meet you!\nI am Piappi, an alien slime girl.\n\nYour illustrations are dynamic and very cute!\nMay I request an illustration from you?\n\nGeneral information...\nI am an alien slime VTuber!\nI'm a slime wearing a human suit with a zipper on the back of my head.\nI live in a spaceship in earth orbit.\n\nI am short (153cm) / Sister character\nShe has double teeth (fangs)\nShe is cheerful, mischievous, mischievous, but really kind.\nLikes: Pickles and tapioca\nWeapon: Pico-Pico-Hammer\nWeapon \uff1a Pico-Pico-Pico-Hammer \u30fbPet \uff1a A spaceship named Obby\n\nRequests\nI would like to commission a Valentine's Day themed illustration. Everything else is free!\n\nOther\nI would like to use it as a YT thumbnail or SNS profile.\nPeople, background, and address are on separate layers.\nPSD file for delivery.\n\nThank you in advance for your continued support.\nPia\ud83d\udc7d\n\n\nThree-sided view:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1puDmQp7RFnCO9U3BeGug4ho-QOe8_jgp/view?usp=sharing\n\nTwin tails:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/121jOUBy0rCVWUggcAl-AeyKPQrGRmhqK/view?usp=sharing\nPonytail:.\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1m6p-Fkmiw8HJIe43ytnn